 Maintenance", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance is the official virtual reality training application for the ImmerseLearn HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. Designed to complement instructor-led and online learning, this immersive simulation enables learners to develop practical chiller inspection and maintenance skills in a safe, interactive environment.\n\nThrough realistic hands-on scenarios, learners practice chiller inspection procedures, preventive maintenance tasks, component identification, safety protocols, operational checks, system monitoring, and basic troubleshooting techniques while following industry best practices.\n\nImportant: This application is not a standalone training product. It is available exclusively to individuals enrolled in the ImmerseLearn HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. Only authorized learners with program access can use this application as part of their required hands-on VR training.", "short_description": "HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance is the VR hands-on training application for the ImmerseLearn HVAC Chiller Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. This application is intended exclusively for enrolled learners and provides immersive, real-world practice in chiller inspection, preventive maintenance, safety procedures, and troubleshooting. Access is available only to users enrolled in the ImmerseLearn program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], 